{# A work order's Mileage on one line (mockup e533d51 / 986d771): the reading and its unit, or a line to
   fill in followed by "KM / MILES" when it is unknown. A legacy mileage may carry its own unit
   ("219823 MILES"), so the unit is added only to a plain number. Vars: mileage (as typed, or null), unit ("KM" / "MILES"). #}
<p class="wo-mileage">Mileage: {% if not mileage %}<span class="wo-blank"></span> KM / MILES{% elseif mileage matches '/^[0-9,. ]+$/' %}{{ mileage }} {{ unit|default('KM') }}{% else %}{{ mileage }}{% endif %}</p>
